msgid "About Us"
msgstr ""

msgid "ABOUT US"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Massachusetts' only Portuguese-English bilingual learning center. "
"Our child-centered curriculum, inspired by Montessori principles and diverse "
"educational philosophies, blends Brazilian warmth with American innovation, "
"creating an extraordinary foundation for your child's global future."
msgstr ""

msgid "<b>A Dream Born </b> from Love"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When we moved to Massachusetts, we searched everywhere for a place that "
"would truly embrace our daughters' bilingual, bicultural identity. We "
"visited many wonderful schools, but none felt like home for children growing "
"up between two worlds. As we watched Megan and Maisie navigate between "
"Portuguese at home and English everywhere else, we realized we needed to "
"create the school we wished existed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Marcela Vitor Learning Center was born from our love for our children and "
"our vision of a place where Brazilian warmth meets American innovation, "
"where Portuguese and English flow naturally together, and where every child "
"can thrive in a truly multicultural environment. We didn't just open a "
"school - we created the community we wanted for our own daughters."
msgstr ""

msgid "Our <b>Unique Approach</b>"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"What makes Marcela Vitor Learning Center truly special is our commitment to "
"providing Massachusetts' only Portuguese-English bilingual education program "
"with Montessori-inspired principles. We believe in the power of language "
"immersion at an early age, creating an environment where children naturally "
"absorb both languages while engaging in meaningful, hands-on learning "
"experiences."
msgstr ""

msgid "Bilingual Immersion"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Our educators are fluent in both Portuguese and English, providing a natural "
"language-learning environment through daily activities, stories, songs, and "
"conversations. Children develop bilingual skills without formal instruction, "
"absorbing vocabulary, pronunciation, and cultural nuances organically."
msgstr ""

msgid "Montessori-Inspired Learning"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We incorporate key Montessori principles including child-led learning, "
"prepared environments with hands-on materials, mixed-age groupings, "
"uninterrupted work periods, and respect for each child's developmental "
"timeline. These principles support independence, concentration, and "
"intrinsic motivation."
msgstr ""

msgid "Meet <b>Our Founders</b>"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Our Learning Center was founded by a passionate husband-and-wife team with "
"deep expertise in child development, education, and business leadership. "
"Their personal journey as parents inspired the creation of Massachusetts' "
"only Portuguese-English bilingual learning center."
msgstr ""

msgid "Marcela Vitor"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Marcela is a certified bilingual speech-language pathologist with over 9 "
"years of experience in Massachusetts public schools. Her expertise in child "
"development, language acquisition, and special education brings a research-"
"based approach to our curriculum."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Born and raised in Brazil, Marcela holds a Master's degree in Communication "
"Disorders and has completed specialized training in Montessori methods, "
"bilingual education, and early childhood development. Her personal "
"experience raising bilingual children in the United States fuels her passion "
"for creating an environment where children can embrace both languages and "
"cultures."
msgstr ""

msgid "Rodolfo Vitor"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Rodolfo brings over 15 years of business leadership and operations "
"management experience to the Learning Center. His strategic vision and "
"dedication to excellence ensure that our educational environment maintains "
"the highest standards of quality, safety, and innovation."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"With a background in business administration and project management, Rodolfo "
"oversees the operational aspects of the center while sharing in the "
"educational vision. His commitment to creating a welcoming, multicultural "
"community stems from his own journey of raising bilingual children and "
"building bridges between Brazilian and American cultures."
msgstr ""

msgid "Research-Based <b>Excellence in Bilingual Education</b>"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Our educational approach is grounded in extensive research on bilingual "
"development and early childhood education. We combine the best practices "
"from multiple educational philosophies to create a unique learning "
"experience."
msgstr ""

msgid "Cognitive Benefits"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Research shows bilingual children develop enhanced executive function, "
"problem-solving skills, and creative thinking abilities. Our curriculum "
"leverages these natural advantages."
msgstr ""

msgid "Critical Period"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Studies demonstrate that children under 8 years old have a unique "
"neurological capacity for language acquisition. Our program is designed to "
"maximize this critical window of opportunity."
msgstr ""

msgid "Cultural Awareness"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Research confirms that early exposure to multiple languages fosters greater "
"cultural sensitivity and openness to diversity. Our children develop the "
"foundation for true global citizenship."
msgstr ""

msgid "Family <b>Testimonials</b>"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Hear from our community of families about their experiences at "
"Massachusetts' only Portuguese-English bilingual learning center."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"As a Brazilian-American family, we were thrilled to find a learning center "
"where our daughter could develop her Portuguese alongside English. She's now "
"4 and switches effortlessly between both languages. The teachers are "
"incredible—warm, patient, and truly dedicated. It's not just education; it's "
"a community that celebrates our heritage."
msgstr ""

msgid "Ana & Mark Thompson"
msgstr ""

msgid "Parents of Sophia, age 4"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We're not a Brazilian family, but we wanted our children to grow up "
"bilingual. The opportunity to learn Portuguese in such a nurturing "
"environment has been incredible. The Montessori-inspired approach means our "
"son is thriving academically while developing confidence and independence. "
"He's learning so much more than just language."
msgstr ""

msgid "Jennifer & David Miller"
msgstr ""

msgid "Parents of Lucas, age 3"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Our 7-month-old has been in the infant program for two months, and we "
"couldn't be happier. The teachers truly understand baby development and "
"provide such individualized care. They speak to him in both languages "
"throughout the day, and we're already seeing his responsiveness to "
"Portuguese words. The environment is so nurturing—it feels like an extension "
"of our family."
msgstr ""

msgid "Carolina & James Wilson"
msgstr ""

msgid "Parents of Benjamin, 7 months"
msgstr ""

msgid "Calendar"
msgstr ""

msgid "School Calendar"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"View our school calendar to see upcoming events, scheduled visits, and "
"availability."
msgstr ""

msgid "You can also subscribe to our calendar using the link below:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Subscribe to Calendar"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We're excited to connect with you about Massachusetts' only Portuguese-"
"English bilingual learning center for children ages 3 months to 8 years. "
"Whether you have questions about our programs, enrollment process, or would "
"like to schedule a visit, we're here to help!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We'd love to hear from you about our bilingual Portuguese-English programs "
"for children ages 3 months to 8 years. Fill out the form below to schedule a "
"tour of our child-centered, Montessori-inspired learning environment, and "
"we'll get back to you as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

msgid "The Bilingual Advantage at Marcela Vitor Learning Center"
msgstr ""

msgid "Massachusetts' Only"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We are the only learning center in Massachusetts offering a true Portuguese-"
"English bilingual environment for children from 3 months to 8 years old."
msgstr ""

msgid "Child-Centered"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Our Montessori-inspired approach respects each child's unique developmental "
"journey while fostering independence, curiosity, and love for learning."
msgstr ""

msgid "Research-Based"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Our program is grounded in research showing that children under 8 have a "
"unique neurological capacity for language acquisition and cognitive "
"development."
msgstr ""

msgid "BRIGHT BEGINNINGS!"
msgstr ""

msgid "Where Child-Centered Learning Meets Multicultural Excellence"
msgstr ""

msgid "JOIN US!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Discover the transformative power of authentic bilingual education at "
"Marcela Vitor Learning Center, the only Portuguese-English immersion program "
"in Massachusetts."
msgstr ""

msgid "LEARN MORE"
msgstr ""

msgid "ENROLLMENT OPEN FOR 2025-2026!"
msgstr ""

