msgid "A <b>Bilingual</b> Advantage for Your Child"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"At Marcela Vitor Learning Center, we believe every child possesses unlimited "
"potential. Our unique blend of educational philosophies—drawing inspiration "
"from Montessori principles, Reggio Emilia approaches, and modern early "
"childhood research—combined with bilingual immersion creates an environment "
"where children don't just learn—they flourish."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"As Massachusetts' exclusive Portuguese-English learning center, we offer "
"something no other program can: authentic cultural bridge-building that "
"prepares your child for an interconnected world."
msgstr ""

msgid "Our Educational <b>Philosophy</b>"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We emphasize child-led discovery, hands-on learning, and respect for each "
"child's natural development."
msgstr ""

msgid "Reggio Emilia Project-Based Learning"
msgstr ""

msgid "We view children as capable researchers and our environment as the \\"
msgstr ""

msgid "Authentic Bilingual Immersion"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Our program is true cultural immersion, where children acquire both "
"languages naturally through meaningful interactions."
msgstr ""

msgid "Play-Based Learning Philosophy"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We understand that play is a child's work. Our curriculum integrates "
"purposeful play that develops social skills, emotional regulation, and "
"creativity."
msgstr ""

msgid "Social-Emotional Development Focus"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We prioritize emotional intelligence alongside academic growth, helping "
"children develop empathy and resilience."
msgstr ""

msgid "Family Partnership Approach"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We believe education is most effective when families and schools work "
"together, maintaining open and transparent communication."
msgstr ""

msgid "OUR <b>PROGRAMS</b>"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"From infants to school-age, our bilingual Portuguese-English programs are "
"designed to nurture the whole child in a Montessori-inspired environment."
msgstr ""

msgid "VIEW ALL PROGRAMS"
msgstr ""

msgid "INFANT PROGRAM"
msgstr ""

msgid "Ages 3 - 15 months"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Our nurturing infant program provides a warm, safe environment where babies "
"develop at their own pace with responsive bilingual caregiving."
msgstr ""

msgid "TODDLER PROGRAM"
msgstr ""

msgid "Ages 15 months - 3 years"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Our toddler program embraces exploration and growing independence with "
"activities that develop self-help skills and bilingual language abilities."
msgstr ""

msgid "PRESCHOOL PROGRAM"
msgstr ""

msgid "Ages 3-5 years"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Our preschool program fosters a love of learning through exploration and "
"discovery with Montessori-inspired materials and strong bilingual "
"development."
msgstr ""

msgid "SCHOOL-AGE PROGRAM"
msgstr ""

msgid "Ages 5-8 years"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Our school-age program continues the bilingual immersion experience while "
"supporting academic growth aligned with Massachusetts curriculum standards."
msgstr ""

msgid "Ready to <b>Begin?</b>"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Contact us today to schedule your tour and discover why families throughout "
"Massachusetts choose Marcela Vitor Learning Center for their children's most "
"important years. Together, we'll build the foundation for your child's "
"brilliant future."
msgstr ""

msgid "Schedule a Tour"
msgstr ""

msgid "Programs"
msgstr ""

msgid "OUR PROGRAMS"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"As Massachusetts' only Portuguese-English bilingual learning center with "
"Montessori-inspired educational principles, we offer developmentally "
"appropriate programs for children ages 3 months to 8 years."
msgstr ""

msgid "Our <b>Child-Centered Approach</b>"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Our bilingual immersion approach provides a seamless experience in both "
"English and Portuguese, creating natural language acquisition. We follow "
"Montessori-inspired principles that respect each child's development pace "
"while encouraging independence, curiosity, and a love for learning in "
"children from infancy through early elementary years."
msgstr ""

msgid "Infant Program"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Our nurturing infant program provides a warm, safe environment where babies "
"develop at their own pace. We focus on responsive caregiving that builds "
"trust and security while promoting language, motor, and social development "
"through gentle guidance and bilingual interaction."
msgstr ""

msgid "Low teacher-to-child ratios for individualized care"
msgstr ""

msgid "Sensory-rich environments that stimulate development"
msgstr ""

msgid "Daily communication with families about milestones and care"
msgstr ""

msgid "Toddler Program"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Our toddler program embraces this age of exploration and growing "
"independence. Through carefully designed environments and activities, "
"toddlers develop self-help skills, language abilities in both English and "
"Portuguese, and positive social interactions."
msgstr ""

msgid "Practical life activities that develop independence"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Language-rich environment with songs, stories, and conversation in both "
"languages"
msgstr ""

msgid "Supportive toilet learning when developmentally ready"
msgstr ""

msgid "Preschool Program"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Our preschool program fosters a love of learning through exploration and "
"discovery. Children engage with Montessori-inspired materials across "
"curriculum areas while developing strong bilingual skills and cultural "
"appreciation."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Hands-on learning experiences in mathematics, language, science, and culture"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Daily opportunities for creative expression through art, music, and movement"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Social-emotional development through collaborative projects and conflict "
"resolution"
msgstr ""

msgid "School-Age Program"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Our school-age program builds on the strong foundation established in our "
"early childhood programs, continuing the bilingual immersion experience "
"while supporting academic growth aligned with Massachusetts curriculum "
"standards."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Advanced literacy and numeracy development in both Portuguese and English"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Project-based learning that integrates science, technology, engineering, "
"arts, and mathematics"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Cultural studies that build global awareness and appreciation for diversity"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"After-school and vacation programs that extend the bilingual learning "
"experience"
msgstr ""

msgid "Ready to Give Your Child the Bilingual Advantage?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Research shows that the critical period for language acquisition happens "
"before age 8. Don't miss this window of opportunity. Schedule a visit to "
"tour our center, meet our teachers, and learn more about how our unique "
"bilingual Montessori-inspired approach can benefit your child's cognitive, "
"social, and linguistic development."
msgstr ""

